  "description": "Fitted to a clean recording of the machine with Decay low, Tune and Attack at mid. A 32-semitone sweep that stays high for the first 10 ms (about 220 Hz at 5 ms, 155 Hz at 10 ms) down to 65 Hz on C4 or the 909's 52 Hz on G#3; the body holds full level for 50 ms, then falls in about 110 ms. The attack edge is a square at a locked phase. The hit runs its course whatever the gate.",
